       Identification Division.                                         00010000
       Program-ID. F115ICA0.                                            00020000
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030000
      *################################################################*00040000
      *                                                                 00050000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060000
      *                                                                 00070000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Contract_Amount.  00080000
      *                                                                 00090000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00100000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00110000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00120000
      *                                                                 00130000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00140000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00150000
      *                                                                 00160000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00170000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00180000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      *                                                                 00210000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00220000
      *                                                                 00230000
      *    Initialize                          R115ICA0-Contract-Amount 00240000
      *    Set   R115ICA0-Version        To    True                     00250000
      *    Set   R115ICA0-In-Select      To    True                     00260000
      *                                                                 00270000
      * One of these:                                                   00280000
      * 1) Set   R115ICA0-In-Actual      To    True                     00290000
      * 2) Set   R115ICA0-In-Work        To    True                     00300000
      *                                                                 00310000
      *    Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00320000
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115ICA0-In-Contract-Type00330000
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115ICA0-In-Contract-No  00340000
      *    Move  &currency (ISO 4217)    To    R115ICA0-In-Currency     00350000
      *                                                                 00360000
      *    Call  'F115ICA0'              Using R115ICA0-Contract-Amount 00370000
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00380000
      *    End-Call                                                     00390000
      *                                                                 00400000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00410000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00420000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00430000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00440000
      *                                                                 00450000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00460000
      *        ...not found...                                          00470000
      *                                                                 00480000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00490000
      *        ...found...                                              00500000
      *                                                                 00510000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00520000
      *                                                                 00530000
      *################################################################*00540000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00550000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00560000
      *190600!HLR! Removed cursors CT, CN, CU, FI-CN, FI-CU,     !LO18! 00570000
      *      !   ! CT-CN, CT-CU, CN-CU, FI-CT-CU, FI-CN-CU,      !    ! 00580000
      *      !   ! CT-CN-CU.                                     !    ! 00590000
      *      !   ! Changed cursor-qual. on FK_TFMC_Contr_Type    !    ! 00600000
      *      !   ! from "Like" to "=".                           !    ! 00610000
      *      !   ! Removed interval on Contract-No.              !    ! 00620000
      *290199!HLR! New module                                    !LG10! 00630000
      *################################################################*00640000
       Environment Division.                                            00650000
       Configuration Section.                                           00660000
       Special-Names.                                                   00670000
           Decimal-Point Is Comma.                                      00680000
      *                                                                 00690000
      *################################################################*00700000
       Data Division.                                                   00710000
       Working-Storage Section.                                         00720000
      *                                                                 00730000
       01  Filler.                                                      00740000
      *                                                                 00750000
           05  W-Table-Name              Pic  X(18) Value               00760000
                                                   'TF_Contract_Amount'.00770000
             88  SW-Table-Actual             Value 'TF_Contract_Amount'.00780000
             88  SW-Table-Work               Value 'TF_Work_CA        '.00790000
      *                                                                 00800000
           05  W-IO-Length               Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00810000
           05  W-Tally                   Pic S9(05)              Comp.  00820000
      *                                                                 00830000
           05  WD-Length                 Pic  Z.ZZ9.                    00840000
      *                                                                 00850000
           05  Ind-WS-Put                Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00860000
           05  Ind-WS                    Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00870000
           05  W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab          Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00880000
      *                                                                 00890000
           05  Filler.                                                  00900000
               10  WD-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic  zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz9.       00910000
               10  WD-Contract-No        Pic  9999999.                  00920000
      *                                                                 00930000
           05  Filler.                                                  00940000
               10  W-Fin-Inst-No         Pic  X(18).                    00950000
               10  W-Fin-Inst-ID         Pic  9(18)              Comp-3.00960000
      *                                                                 00970000
           05  W-Input-Action            Pic  X(10).                    00980000
             88  SW-IA-Initialize                   Value 'INITIALIZE'. 00990000
      *                                                                 01000000
      *    This field is needed because of the old interfaces used to   01010000
      *    access Fin-Inst-ID and Customer ID.                          01020000
           05  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr          Pic  9(04).                    01030000
      *                                                                 01040000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01050000
      * Counters, used on cursor read, to return row no. and total      01060000
      * no. of rows.                                                    01070000
      * Total no. of rows is only returned when -In-Count is set on     01080000
      * the Get-1st-call.                                               01090000
      *                                                                 01100000
           05  WC-Counters.                                             01110000
               10  WC-Row-No             Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01120000
               10  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows   Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01130000
      *                                                                 01140000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01150000
      * Switches used for selecting the correct cursor:                 01160000
      *                                                                 01170000
           05  SW-Cursor-Code.                                          01180000
               10  SW-CC-Fin-Inst        Pic  X(01).                    01190000
                 88  SW-Use-Fin-Inst                Value 'F'.          01200000
               10  SW-CC-Contract-Type   Pic  X(01).                    01210000
                 88  SW-Use-Contract-Type           Value 'T'.          01220000
               10  SW-CC-Contract-No     Pic  X(01).                    01230000
                 88  SW-Use-Contract-No             Value 'N'.          01240000
               10  SW-CC-Currency        Pic  X(01).                    01250000
                 88  SW-Use-Currency                Value 'C'.          01260000
      *                                                                 01270000
           05  Filler                    Redefines SW-Cursor-Code       01280000
                                         Pic  X(04).                    01290000
             88  SW-Use-Fi-Asc                      Value 'F   '.       01300000
             88  SW-Use-Fi-CT-Asc                   Value 'FT  '.       01310000
             88  SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-Asc                Value 'FTN '.       01320000
             88  SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-Cu-Asc             Value 'FTNC'.       01330000
      *                                                                 01340000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01350000
      * These fields are used for SQL qualification:                    01360000
      *                                                                 01370000
           05  W-DB-Key.                                                01380000
               10  W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID      Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01390000
               10  W-DB-Contract-Type    Pic  X(03).                    01400000
               10  W-DB-Contract-No      Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01410000
               10  W-DB-Currency         Pic  X(03).                    01420000
      *                                                                 01430000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01440000
      * These fields are used for comparison with the WS-fields.        01450000
      *                                                                 01460000
           05  WE-Cursor-Info.                                          01470000
             07  WE-Key.                                                01480000
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01490000
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01500000
               10  WE-Contract-Type      Pic  X(03).                    01510000
               10  WE-Contract-No        Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01520000
               10  WE-Currency           Pic  X(03).                    01530000
             07  WE-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01540000
               88  WE-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01550000
               88  WE-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01560000
      *                                                                 01570000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01580000
      * Storage, and switches for identifying the content:              01590000
      * The cursor info is used to verify that the get-next has the     01600000
      * same qualification as the get-1st.                              01610000
      *                                                                 01620000
       01  W-Storage.                                                   01630000
      *                                                                 01640000
           05  WS-Cursor-Info.                                          01650000
             07  WS-Key.                                                01660000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01670000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01680000
               10  WS-Contract-Type      Pic  X(03).                    01690000
               10  WS-Contract-No        Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01700000
               10  WS-Currency           Pic  X(03).                    01710000
             07  WS-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01720000
               88  WS-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01730000
               88  WS-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01740000
             07  WS-Cursor-Status        Pic  X(08).                    01750000
               88  WS-Cursor-OK                     Value 'OK'.         01760000
               88  WS-Cursor-End                    Value 'END'.        01770000
      *                                                                 01780000
      * We store all occurences that are read, also those that we do    01790000
      * not find. This is to reduce the number of DB2 accesses.         01800000
      *                                                                 01810000
           05  WS-DB2-Table.                                            01820000
             07  WS-DB2-Row              Occurs 10 Times.               01830000
               10  WS-DB2-Tbl-Version    Pic  X(16).                    01840000
               10  WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01850000
               10  WS-DB2-Contract-Type  Pic  X(03).                    01860000
               10  WS-DB2-Contract-No    Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01870000
               10  WS-DB2-Currency       Pic  X(03).                    01880000
               10  WS-DB2-Row-Status     Pic S9(01)              Comp-3.01890000
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Read                Value +0.           01900000
                 88  WS-DB2-Read                    Value +1.           01910000
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Found               Value +2.           01920000
               10  WS-DB2-DCL            Pic  X(250).                   01930000
      *                                                                 01940000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01950000
      * Areas for use when accessing DB2.                               01960000
      *                                                                 01970000
           Exec SQL Include R115TFCA End-Exec.                          01980000
      *                                                                 01990000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02000000
      * Internal area:                                                  02010000
      *                                                                 02020000
       01  W-Int-IO-Area.                                               02030000
           Copy R115ICA0.                                               02040000
      *                                                                 02050000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02060000
      * Assorted copy-areas:                                            02070000
      *                                                                 02080000
       01  Filler.                                                      02090000
           Copy R115ICAS.                                               02100000
      *                                                                 02110000
       01  Filler.                                                      02120000
           Copy R5879010.                                               02130000
      *                                                                 02140000
       01  Filler.                                                      02150000
           Copy R7918030.                                               02160000
      *                                                                 02170000
       Copy R115X000.                                                   02180000
      *                                                                 02190000
      *################################################################.02200000
       Linkage Section.                                                 02210000
      *                                                                 02220000
       01  L-Ext-IO-Area                 Pic  X(560).                   02230000
       Copy R7919999.                                                   02240000
      *                                                                 02250000
      *################################################################.02260000
       Procedure Division                Using L-Ext-IO-Area            02270000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area.     02280000
      *                                                                 02290000
       A000-Main                         Section.                       02300000
      *                                                                 02310000
           Perform B000-Initialize                                      02320000
      *                                                                 02330000
           Evaluate True                                                02340000
             When SW-IA-Initialize                                      02350000
               Continue                                                 02360000
      *                                                                 02370000
             When Other                                                 02380000
               Perform ZI00-Conv-Input-Version                          02390000
               Perform C000-Interface                                   02400000
               Perform ZO00-Conv-Output-Version                         02410000
      *                                                                 02420000
           End-Evaluate                                                 02430000
      *                                                                 02440000
           Goback.                                                      02450000
      *################################################################*02460000
       B000-Initialize                   Section.                       02470000
      *                                                                 02480000
           Set   R7919999-Return-OK      To    True                     02490000
      *                                                                 02500000
           Evaluate True                                                02510000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:10)   =     'INITIALIZE'             02520000
               Set   Sw-IA-Initialize    To    True                     02530000
             When Other                                                 02540000
               Move  Space               To    W-Input-Action           02550000
           End-Evaluate                                                 02560000
      *                                                                 02570000
           Compute  W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab                                    02580000
               =    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Table             02590000
               /    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Row               02600000
      *                                                                 02610000
           If  Sw-IA-Initialize                                         02620000
           or  WS-DB2-Row-Status (1)     Not   Numeric                  02630000
               Initialize                      W-Storage                02640000
               Move  +0                  To    Ind-WS-Put               02650000
           End-If                                                       02660000
      *                                                                 02670000
           If  WC-Row-No                 Not   Numeric                  02680000
           or  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows       Not   Numeric                  02690000
               Initialize                      WC-Counters              02700000
           End-If                                                       02710000
      *                                                                 02720000
           Evaluate True                                                02730000
             When Not R115X000-Is-Initiated                             02740000
               Initialize                      R115X000-External-Data   02750000
             When Not R115X000-Version                                  02760000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    02770000
               Move  'GL-VERSION-INVALID'                               02780000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  02790000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)02800000
               Move  R115X000-Version-No To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)02810000
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)02820000
               Move  'R115X000'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)02830000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               02840000
               Move  'B001'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       02850000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02860000
           End-Evaluate                                                 02870000
      *                                                                 02880000
           .                                                            02890000
      *################################################################.02900000
       C000-Interface                    Section.                       02910000
      *                                                                 02920000
           Perform C100-Verify                                          02930000
      *                                                                 02940000
           Evaluate True                                                02950000
             When R115ICA0-In-Get-1st                                   02960000
               Perform C200-Initialize-Output                           02970000
               Perform D000-Get-1st                                     02980000
               Perform E000-Get-Next                                    02990000
      *                                                                 03000000
             When R115ICA0-In-Get-Next                                  03010000
               Perform C200-Initialize-Output                           03020000
               Perform E000-Get-Next                                    03030000
      *                                                                 03040000
             When R115ICA0-In-Select                                    03050000
               Perform C200-Initialize-Output                           03060000
               Perform F000-Select                                      03070000
      *                                                                 03080000
             When R115ICA0-In-Insert                                    03090000
               Perform G000-Insert                                      03100000
      *                                                                 03110000
             When R115ICA0-In-Update                                    03120000
               Perform H000-Update                                      03130000
      *                                                                 03140000
             When R115ICA0-In-Delete                                    03150000
               Perform I000-Delete                                      03160000
      *                                                                 03170000
             When Other                                                 03180000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    03190000
               Move  'GL-IN-AKSJON-UV'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  03200000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)03210000
               Move  R115ICA0-In-Action  To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)03220000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               03230000
               Move  'C001'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03240000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03250000
      *                                                                 03260000
           End-Evaluate                                                 03270000
      *                                                                 03280000
           .                                                            03290000
      *################################################################.03300000
       C100-Verify                       Section.                       03310000
      *                                                                 03320000
           Evaluate True                                                03330000
             When R115ICA0-In-Actual                                    03340000
               Set   SW-Table-Actual     To    True                     03350000
      *                                                                 03360000
             When R115ICA0-In-Work                                      03370000
               Set   SW-Table-Work       To    True                     03380000
      *                                                                 03390000
             When other                                                 03400000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    03410000
               Move  'GL-IN-TABLE-VERSION-UV'                           03420000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  03430000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)03440000
               Move  R115ICA0-In-Table-Version                          03450000
                                         To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)03460000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               03470000
               Move  'C101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03480000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03490000
      *                                                                 03500000
           End-Evaluate                                                 03510000
      *                                                                 03520000
           .                                                            03530000
      *################################################################.03540000
       C200-Initialize-Output            Section.                       03550000
      *                                                                 03560000
           Initialize                          R115ICA0-Data            03570000
      *                                                                 03580000
           .                                                            03590000
      *################################################################.03600000
       D000-Get-1st                      Section.                       03610000
      *                                                                 03620000
           Perform D100-Prepare-Input                                   03630000
           Perform D200-Prepare-Qualification                           03640000
           Perform D300-Select-Cursor                                   03650000
           If  R115ICA0-In-CC-Count                                     03660000
               Perform D400-Count-Cursor                                03670000
           End-If                                                       03680000
           Perform D500-Open-Cursor                                     03690000
      *                                                                 03700000
           .                                                            03710000
      *################################################################.03720000
       D100-Prepare-Input                Section.                       03730000
      *                                                                 03740000
      * We create internal from- and to-values, depending on the input. 03750000
      *                                                                 03760000
           Initialize                          WE-Cursor-Info           03770000
      *                                                                 03780000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    WE-Fin-Inst-ID           03790000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-No To    WE-Fin-Inst-No           03800000
      *                                                                 03810000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Contract-Type                              03820000
                                         To    WE-Contract-Type         03830000
      *    Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  03840000
      *    Inspect WE-Contract-Type     Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'03850000
      *    If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       03860000
      *        Inspect WE-Contract-Type  Converting '* ' to '%%'        03870000
      *    End-If                                                       03880000
      *                                                                 03890000
      *                                                                 03900000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Contract-No To    WE-Contract-No           03901000
      *                                                                 03902000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Currency    To    WE-Currency              03903000
           Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  03904000
           Inspect WE-Currency          Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'03905000
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       03906000
               Inspect WE-Currency       Converting '* ' to '%%'        03907000
           End-If                                                       03908000
      *                                                                 03909000
           .                                                            03910000
      *################################################################.03920000
       D200-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       03930000
      *                                                                 03940000
      * We store the qualification, so that we can check that the       03950000
      * qualification do not change on any following Get-Next.          03960000
      *                                                                 03970000
           Initialize                          WS-Cursor-Info           03980000
           Move  WE-Key                  To    WS-Key                   03990000
           Move  WE-Code-Sequence        To    WS-Code-Sequence         04000000
      *                                                                 04010000
           Initialize WC-Counters                                       04020000
      *                                                                 04030000
      * We fill in the SQL host variables.                              04040000
      *                                                                 04050000
           Initialize                          W-DB-Key                 04060000
      *                                                                 04070000
           Move  WE-Fin-Inst-ID          To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID         04080000
           Move  WE-Contract-Type        To    W-DB-Contract-Type       04090000
           Move  WE-Contract-No          To    W-DB-Contract-No         04100000
           Move  WE-Currency             To    W-DB-Currency            04110000
      *                                                                 04120000
           If  WE-Fin-Inst-No            Not = Space                    04130000
           and W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID          =     +0                       04140000
               Move  WE-Fin-Inst-No      To    W-Fin-Inst-No            04150000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           04160000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID         04170000
           End-If                                                       04180000
      *                                                                 04190000
           .                                                            04200000
      *################################################################.04210000
       D300-Select-Cursor                Section.                       04220000
      *                                                                 04230000
      * We choose which cursor to use, depending on the qualification.  04240000
      *                                                                 04250000
           Move  Space                   To    SW-Cursor-Code           04260000
      *                                                                 04270000
           If  W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID          Not = +0                       04280000
               Set  Sw-Use-Fin-Inst      To    True                     04290000
           End-If                                                       04300000
      *                                                                 04310000
           If  W-DB-Contract-Type        Not = Space                    04320000
      *    and W-DB-Contract-Type (1:1)  Not = '%'                      04330000
               Set   SW-Use-Contract-Type                               04340000
                                         To    True                     04350000
           End-If                                                       04360000
      *                                                                 04370000
           If  W-DB-Contract-No          Not = +0                       04380000
               Set   SW-Use-Contract-No  To    True                     04390000
           End-If                                                       04400000
      *                                                                 04410000
           If  W-DB-Currency             Not = Space                    04420000
           and W-DB-Currency (1:1)       Not = '%'                      04430000
               Set  Sw-Use-Currency      To    True                     04440000
           End-If                                                       04450000
      *                                                                 04460000
           Evaluate True                                                04470000
             When SW-Use-Fi-Asc                                         04480000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-Asc                                      04490000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-Asc                                   04500000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-Cu-Asc                                04510000
               Continue                                                 04520000
      *                                                                 04530000
             When other                                                 04540000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    04550000
               Move  'GL-CURSOR-UV'      To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  04560000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)04570000
               Move  SW-Cursor-Code      To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)04580000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               04590000
               Move  'D302'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       04600000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       04610000
      *                                                                 04620000
           End-Evaluate                                                 04630000
      *                                                                 04640000
           .                                                            04650000
      *################################################################.04660000
       D400-Count-Cursor                 Section.                       04670000
      *                                                                 04680000
           Initialize                          R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  04690000
           Set   R115ICAS-Version        To    True                     04700000
           Set   R115ICAS-In-Count-Cursor                               04710000
                                         To    True                     04720000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Table-Version                              04730000
                                         To    R115ICAS-In-Table-Version04740000
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ICAS-Cursor-Code     04750000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ICAS-DB-Key          04760000
      *                                                                 04770000
           Call  'F115ICAR'              Using R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  04780000
                                               DCLTF-Contract-Amount    04790000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      04800000
           End-Call                                                     04810000
      *                                                                 04820000
           Evaluate True                                                04830000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    04840000
               Move  R115ICAS-Out-Total-Rows                            04850000
                                         To    WC-Total-No-Of-Rows      04860000
      *                                                                 04870000
             When other                                                 04880000
               Move  'D401'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       04890000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       04900000
      *                                                                 04910000
           End-Evaluate                                                 04920000
      *                                                                 04930000
           .                                                            04940000
      *################################################################.04950000
       D500-Open-Cursor                  Section.                       04960000
      *                                                                 04970000
           Initialize                          R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  04980000
           Set   R115ICAS-Version        To    True                     04990000
           Set   R115ICAS-In-Open-Cursor To    True                     05000000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Table-Version                              05010000
                                         To    R115ICAS-In-Table-Version05020000
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ICAS-Cursor-Code     05030000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ICAS-DB-Key          05040000
      *                                                                 05050000
           Call  'F115ICAR'              Using R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  05060000
                                               DCLTF-Contract-Amount    05070000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      05080000
           End-Call                                                     05090000
      *                                                                 05100000
           Evaluate True                                                05110000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    05120000
               Set   WS-Cursor-OK        To    True                     05130000
      *                                                                 05140000
             When other                                                 05150000
               Move  'D501'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05160000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05170000
      *                                                                 05180000
           End-Evaluate                                                 05190000
      *                                                                 05200000
           .                                                            05210000
      *################################################################.05220000
       E000-Get-Next                     Section.                       05230000
      *                                                                 05240000
           Perform D100-Prepare-Input                                   05250000
           Perform E100-Check-Qualification                             05260000
           Perform E200-Fetch-Cursor                                    05270000
      *                                                                 05280000
           If  R7919999-Return-OK                                       05290000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   05300000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 05310000
           End-If                                                       05320000
      *                                                                 05330000
           .                                                            05340000
      *################################################################.05350000
       E100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       05360000
      *                                                                 05370000
      * We use the WE-fields for comparison with the WS-fields.         05380000
      * This to verify that the qualification has not changes since     05390000
      * the Get-1st.                                                    05400000
      *                                                                 05410000
           Evaluate True                                                05420000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   05430000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         05440000
             and  WS-Cursor-OK                                          05450000
               Continue                                                 05460000
      *                                                                 05470000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   05480000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         05490000
             and  WS-Cursor-End                                         05500000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05510000
               Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE'     To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05520000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05530000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05540000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05550000
               Move  'E101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05560000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05570000
      *                                                                 05580000
             When Other                                                 05590000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05600000
               Move  'GL-BRUK-GET-1ST'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05610000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05620000
               Move  'E102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05630000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05640000
      *                                                                 05650000
           End-Evaluate                                                 05660000
      *                                                                 05670000
           .                                                            05680000
      *################################################################.05690000
       E200-Fetch-Cursor                 Section.                       05700000
      *                                                                 05710000
           Initialize                          R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  05720000
           Set   R115ICAS-Version        To    True                     05730000
           Set   R115ICAS-In-Fetch-Cursor                               05740000
                                         To    True                     05750000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Table-Version                              05760000
                                         To    R115ICAS-In-Table-Version05770000
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ICAS-Cursor-Code     05780000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ICAS-DB-Key          05790000
      *                                                                 05800000
           Call  'F115ICAR'              Using R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  05810000
                                               DCLTF-Contract-Amount    05820000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      05830000
           End-Call                                                     05840000
      *                                                                 05850000
           Evaluate True                                                05860000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    05870000
               Add   +1                  To    WC-Row-No                05880000
      *                                                                 05890000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 05900000
               Set   WS-Cursor-End       To    True                     05910000
               If  WC-Row-No             =     +0                       05920000
                 Then                                                   05930000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    05940000
                   Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF'                              05950000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05960000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05970000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05980000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           05990000
                 Else                                                   06000000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    06010000
                   Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06020000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06030000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06040000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           06050000
               End-If                                                   06060000
      *                                                                 06070000
             When other                                                 06080000
               Move  'E201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06090000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06100000
      *                                                                 06110000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06120000
      *                                                                 06130000
           .                                                            06140000
      *################################################################.06150000
       F000-Select                       Section.                       06160000
      *                                                                 06170000
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           06180000
      *                                                                 06190000
      * We will first look through the storage, to see if we have       06200000
      * already got the wanted occurence.                               06210000
      *                                                                 06220000
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        06230000
      *                                                                 06240000
      * If we didn't find anything, we need to read. Then we store.     06250000
      *                                                                 06260000
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         06270000
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 06280000
               Perform F200-Select-Row                                  06290000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   06300000
           End-If                                                       06310000
      *                                                                 06320000
      * At last we check what we've got to offer.                       06330000
      *                                                                 06340000
           Evaluate True                                                06350000
             When WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS)                                  06360000
               Move  WS-DB2-DCL (Ind-WS) To    DCLTF-Contract-Amount    06370000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 06380000
      *                                                                 06390000
             When other                                                 06400000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06410000
               Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF-Q' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06420000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06430000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06440000
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)06450000
               Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID  To WD-Fin-Inst-ID              06460000
               Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No    To WD-Contract-No              06470000
               String WD-Fin-Inst-ID           Delimited by size        06480000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        06490000
                      FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       Delimited by space       06500000
                      WD-Contract-No           Delimited by space       06510000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        06520000
                      TFCA-Currency            Delimited by space       06530000
                                       Into R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)06540000
               End-String                                               06550000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06560000
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              06570000
                                         To    True                     06580000
      *                                                                 06590000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06600000
      *                                                                 06610000
           .                                                            06620000
      *################################################################.06630000
       F100-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       06640000
      *                                                                 06650000
      * We fill in the host variables for the SQL.                      06660000
      *                                                                 06670000
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Contract-Amount    06680000
      *                                                                 06690000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       06700000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Contract-Type                              06710000
                                         To    FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       06720000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Contract-No To    FK-TFMC-Contr-No         06730000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Currency    To    TFCA-Currency            06740000
      *                                                                 06750000
           If  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-No   Not = Space                    06760000
           and R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID   =     +0                       06770000
               Move  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-No                            06780000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            06790000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           06800000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       06810000
           End-If                                                       06820000
      *                                                                 06830000
           .                                                            06840000
      *################################################################.06850000
       F200-Select-Row                   Section.                       06860000
      *                                                                 06870000
           Initialize                          R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  06880000
           Set   R115ICAS-Version        To    True                     06890000
           Set   R115ICAS-In-Select      To    True                     06900000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Table-Version                              06910000
                                         To    R115ICAS-In-Table-Version06920000
      *                                                                 06930000
           Call  'F115ICAR'              Using R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  06940000
                                               DCLTF-Contract-Amount    06950000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      06960000
           End-Call                                                     06970000
      *                                                                 06980000
           Evaluate True                                                06990000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    07000000
               Continue                                                 07010000
      *                                                                 07020000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 07030000
               Continue                                                 07040000
      *                                                                 07050000
             When other                                                 07060000
               Move  'F201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07070000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       07080000
      *                                                                 07090000
           End-Evaluate                                                 07100000
      *                                                                 07110000
           .                                                            07120000
      *################################################################.07130000
       G000-Insert                       Section.                       07140000
