           Perform G100-Move-Input-To-DCL                               07160000
           Perform G200-Insert-Row                                      07170000
      *                                                                 07180000
           Perform L300-Remove-DCL                                      07190000
           Perform L100-Store-DCL                                       07200000
      *                                                                 07210000
           .                                                            07220000
      *################################################################.07230000
       G100-Move-Input-To-DCL            Section.                       07240000
      *                                                                 07250000
      * PLEASE REMEMBER:                                                07260000
      *    When you modify the code in this section, you need to do     07270000
      *    the same modifications in module F115ACA0 - E200-section.    07280000
      *                                                                 07290000
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Contract-Amount    07300000
      *                                                                 07310000
           Move R115ICA0-Fin-Inst-ID     To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       07320000
           If  R115ICA0-Fin-Inst-No      Not = Space                    07330000
           and R115ICA0-Fin-Inst-ID      =     +0                       07340000
               Move  R115ICA0-Fin-Inst-No                               07350000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            07360000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           07370000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       07380000
           End-If                                                       07390000
      *                                                                 07400000
           Move R115ICA0-Contract-Type   To    FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       07410000
           Move R115ICA0-Contract-No     To    FK-TFMC-Contr-No         07420000
      *                                                                 07430000
           Move R115ICA0-Currency        To    TFCA-Currency            07440000
           Move R115ICA0-Original-Amount To    TFCA-Orig-Amount         07450000
           Move R115ICA0-Remaining-Amount                               07460000
                                         To    TFCA-Remain-Amount       07470000
           Move R115ICA0-Min-Pct-Tolerance                              07480000
                                         To    TFCA-Min-Pct-Toler       07490000
           Move R115ICA0-Max-Pct-Tolerance                              07500000
                                         To    TFCA-Max-Pct-Toler       07510000
           Move R115ICA0-Prev-O-Amount   To    TFCA-Prev-O-Amount       07520000
           Move R115ICA0-Curr-O-Amount   To    TFCA-Curr-O-Amount       07530000
      *                                                                 07540000
           .                                                            07550000
      *################################################################.07560000
       G200-Insert-Row                   Section.                       07570000
